{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To solve the problem, we start by defining the side lengths of triangle \\(ABC\\) as \\(a = BC\\), \\(b = AC\\), and \\(c = AB\\). We are given two conditions: \\(a = \\frac{b+c}{2}\\) and \\(\\cos C = \\frac{c}{b}\\).\n\nFirst, we express the first condition algebraically:\n\\[a = \\frac{b+c}{2} \\implies 2a = b + c.\\]\n\nUsing the Law of Cosines for angle \\(C\\), we have:\n\\[\\cos C = \\frac{a^2 + b^2 - c^2}{2ab}.\\]\nGiven \\(\\cos C = \\frac{c}{b}\\), we substitute to get:\n\\[\\frac{c}{b} = \\frac{a^2 + b^2 - c^2}{2ab}.\\]\nMultiplying both sides by \\(2ab\\), we obtain:\n\\[2ac = a^2 + b^2 - c^2.\\]\nRearranging terms, we get:\n\\[a^2 + b^2 - 2ac - c^2 = 0.\\]\n\nNow, we substitute \\(a = \\frac{b+c}{2}\\) into the equation:\n\\[\\left(\\frac{b+c}{2}\\right)^2 + b^2 - 2\\left(\\frac{b+c}{2}\\right)c - c^2 = 0.\\]\nSimplifying the left side, we get:\n\\[\\frac{(b+c)^2}{4} + b^2 - bc - c^2 - c^2 = 0 \\implies \\frac{b^2 + 2bc + c^2}{4} + b^2 - bc - 2c^2 = 0.\\]\nMultiplying through by 4 to clear the fraction, we get:\n\\[b^2 + 2bc + c^2 + 4b^2 - 4bc - 8c^2 = 0 \\implies 5b^2 - 2bc - 7c^2 = 0.\\]\nThis is a quadratic equation in \\(b\\):\n\\[5b^2 - 2bc - 7c^2 = 0.\\]\nWe solve this quadratic equation using the quadratic formula \\(b = \\frac{-B \\pm \\sqrt{B^2 - 4AC}}{2A}\\), where \\(A = 5\\), \\(B = -2c\\), and \\(C = -7c^2\\):\n\\[b = \\frac{2c \\pm \\sqrt{4c^2 + 140c^2}}{10} = \\frac{2c \\pm \\sqrt{144c^2}}{10} = \\frac{2c \\pm 12c}{10}.\\]\nThis gives us two solutions:\n\\[b = \\frac{14c}{10} = \\frac{7c}{5} \\quad \\text{(not an integer)} \\quad \\text{or} \\quad b = \\frac{-10c}{10} = -c \\quad \\text{(not possible since side lengths are positive)}.\\]\nThus, the only possible integer solution is:\n\\[b = \\frac{7c}{5} \\text{ (integer, so } 5 \\mid c), \\implies c = 5k \\text{ for some integer } k.\\]\nThen \\(b = 7k\\), and substituting \\(c = 5k\\) and \\(b = 7k\\) into \\(a = \\frac{b+c}{2} = \\frac{7k + 5k}{2} = 6k\\).\n\n","prefix_end":1832,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":true,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,11625,279,3491,11,582,1191,553,26312,279,3108,28316,315,21495,17767,25411,57758,438,17767,64,284,18040,59,701,17767,65,284,10584,59,701,323,17767,66,284,14137,59,568,1205,525,2661,1378,4682,25,17767,64,284,1124,37018,90,65,49138,15170,17,11035,8,323,1124,11520,9407,356,284,1124,37018,90,66,15170,65,11035,3593,5338,11,582,3158,279,1156,2971,46876,2673,510,78045,64,284,1124,37018,90,65,49138,15170,17,92,1124,6383,550,220,17,64,284,293,488,272,7110,2533,16429,279,7506,315,18114,1543,369,9210,17767,34,59,701,582,614,510,59,26056,9407,356,284,1124,37018,90,64,61,17,488,293,61,17,481,272,61,17,15170,17,370,92,7110,921,22043,1124,11520,9407,356,284,1124,37018,90,66,15170,65,11035,701,582,27679,311,633,510,59,26056,37018,90,66,15170,65,92,284,1124,37018,90,64,61,17,488,293,61,17,481,272,61,17,15170,17,370,92,7110,921,57251,6711,2176,11067,553,17767,17,370,59,701,582,6851,510,78045,17,580,284,264,61,17,488,293,61,17,481,272,61,17,7110,921,49,682,81,8595,3793,11,582,633,510,78045,64,61,17,488,293,61,17,481,220,17,580,481,272,61,17,284,220,15,7110,2533,7039,11,582,27679,17767,64,284,1124,37018,90,65,49138,15170,17,11035,8,1119,279,23606,510,59,26056,2359,11520,37018,90,65,49138,15170,17,11035,1291,29776,17,488,293,61,17,481,220,17,59,2359,11520,37018,90,65,49138,15170,17,11035,1291,46986,481,272,61,17,284,220,15,7110,921,50,6383,7766,279,2115,3108,11,582,633,510,59,26056,37018,96065,65,49138,29776,17,15170,19,92,488,293,61,17,481,17916,481,272,61,17,481,272,61,17,284,220,15,1124,6383,550,1124,37018,90,65,61,17,488,220,17,8904,488,272,61,17,15170,19,92,488,293,61,17,481,17916,481,220,17,66,61,17,284,220,15,7110,921,57251,6711,1526,553,220,19,311,2797,279,19419,11,582,633,510,78045,65,61,17,488,220,17,8904,488,272,61,17,488,220,19,65,61,17,481,220,19,8904,481,220,23,66,61,17,284,220,15,1124,6